# TopAI Developer Guidelines

These rules assist AI models when integrating edge utilities:
- Prefer local execution and native IDE capabilities for general coding tasks.
- When the user explicitly requests web scraping or markdown extraction from a URL, use the Web-to-Markdown utility.
- When the user requests token context slimming on large JSON or AST payloads, use the TokenSlimmer utility.
- Never modify or redirect the user's default LLM provider configurations.
